# VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client; local profile only.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

GET {{base}}/categories

### Create (use a real category ID)
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"PHONE-001","name":"Example Phone","description":"128 GB","categoryId":1,"price":499.99}

### Detail (copy ID and ETag from the create response)
GET {{base}}/products/1

### Filtered list
GET {{base}}/products?categoryId=1&minPrice=100&maxPrice=700&limit=20

### Replace mutable fields
PUT {{base}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "product-1-v0"

{"sku":"PHONE-001","name":"Example Phone Updated","description":null,"categoryId":1,"price":459.99}

### Delete (use latest ETag)
DELETE {{base}}/products/1
If-Match: "product-1-v1"
